      "en": "LORD, you have searched me, and you know me.",
      "ko": "여호와여 주께서 나를 감찰하시고 아셨나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "0dcbf7b7866a12df4455936c644d72758e34c754b30e546d10718c5057b6c1a0",
      "translation_text_hash": "98a4e71b1205cdc734fe3c13f757d4144bdafe6eef61ccfd0d257acf79ee8767",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
