          "chapter": 139,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "You know my sitting down and my rising up. You perceive my thoughts from afar.",
      "ko": "주께서 나의 앉고 일어섬을 아시며 멀리서도 나의 생각을 통촉하시오며",
      "source_text_hash": "3e40a3076a01dca95e3b03af00c56971f3d08112be47874c3a07e21f1be8d322",
      "translation_text_hash": "c86e56183ee6d8a989663ea31a5383ba2a2fcd1dcf8b350e89aa90de21c1e393",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
