      "en": "You hem me in behind and before. You laid your hand on me.",
      "ko": "주께서 나의 전후를 두르시며 내게 안수하셨나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "59e7456078e6670aec773c9049c8670823b561d0eee18fa7726093ab3cf305b6",
      "translation_text_hash": "9272734fb3d5b906733b7e2f665a12fc00586ec05f3559b05571875be7ddcd8d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
